mw2coop patch for maps/cliffhanger_snowmobile.gsc (Cliffhanger, Modern Warfare 2, 64-bit Steam build)
Co-op logic lives in mw2coop/scripts/maps/_mw2coop_cliffhanger.gsc. Outside a co-op campaign
session every change does what the original did.

1. After the icepick fight: a second snowmobile for player 2 next to player 1's.
@@@ replace
	level.player_snowmobile thread remind_player_to_get_on_snowmobile();
@@@ with
	level.player_snowmobile thread remind_player_to_get_on_snowmobile();
	level.player_snowmobile maps\_mw2coop_cliffhanger::partner_snowmobile( player_snowmobile_spawner, false );
@@@ end

2. Either player may take either snowmobile; the one player 1 rides is level.player_snowmobile.
@@@ replace
	level.player_snowmobile waittill( "vehicle_mount", otherEnt );
@@@ with
	otherEnt = level.player_snowmobile maps\_mw2coop_cliffhanger::wait_player1_mounts();
@@@ end

3. Start point "snowmobile": player 2 starts on his own snowmobile too.
@@@ replace
	level.player player_mount_vehicle( level.player_snowmobile );
@@@ with
	level.player player_mount_vehicle( level.player_snowmobile );
	level.player_snowmobile maps\_mw2coop_cliffhanger::partner_snowmobile( player_snowmobile_spawner, true );
@@@ end

4. The helicopter ending starts only once player 2 has arrived next to player 1.
@@@ replace
	flag_wait( "end_begins" );
@@@ with
	flag_wait( "end_begins" );
	maps\_mw2coop_cliffhanger::wait_partner_at_end();
@@@ end
